Package: manager
Title: Tools for Environmental Monitoring Data Analysis and Visualization
Version: 0.5.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Jent", , "jentjr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for managing, analyzing, and visualizing
    environmental monitoring data. Includes a schema-based data model for
    standardized environmental datasets, statistical summaries, trend
    analysis, censored-data methods, prediction and tolerance intervals,
    groundwater monitoring workflows, and hydrochemical visualizations
    including Piper, Durov, Schoeller, and Stiff diagrams. Supports
    integration with external environmental data sources such as MANAGES.
